682, "prose": "<div class=q-split><div class=q-split-l><h2>4 Easy Steps to get you Onboarded Successfully</h2></div><div class=q-split-r><div class=\"q-cards q-cards-2\"><div class=q-card><span class=q-ico style=\"display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a44a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"/></svg></span><h4>Kickoff & Discovery</h4><p>Within 7 business days, you\u2019ll meet your dedicated HubSpot Strategist. This initial session is all about understanding your business, goals, and setting the foundation for a successful onboarding experience.</p></div><div class=q-card><span class=q-ico style=\"display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a44a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7z\"/></svg></span><h4>Strategy & Mapping</h4><p>In the following week, you\u2019ll work closely with your Strategist to align on a tailored onboarding plan\u2014mapped directly to your objectives and designed for a seamless rollout.</p></div><div class=q-card><span class=q-ico style=\"display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a44a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 15l4-5 3 3 5-7\"/></svg></span><h4>Guided Implementation</h4><p>Over the next 4\u20136 weeks, our team will guide you through every key step. You\u2019ll gain hands-on experience and confidence using HubSpot, supported by experts who keep your progress on track.</p></div><div class=q-card><span class=q-ico style=\"display:inline-flex;margin-bottom:14px\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4a44a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M5 5l2 2M17 17l2 2M19 5l-2 2M7 17l-2 2\"/></svg></span><h4>Confident Execution</h4><p>By the end of onboarding, your team will be fully equipped to manage HubSpot independently. With systems in place and knowledge in hand, you\u2019re ready to make HubSpot a core part of your operations.</p></div></div></div></div>"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "c3", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "quantum-cta-band", "name": "w3", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "cta_label": "Book a call", "heading": "Ready to maximize your growth?", "module_id": 217248524161, "subhead": "Book a call and we will map your path to a unified revenue engine."}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, "htmlTitle": "Onboarding | Quantum Business Solutions", "metaDescription": null}